orch image runs to successful\n54\t  completion on AMD Instinct nodes.\n55\t- A multi-GPU (multi-worker) PyTorchJob runs to successful completion with\n56\t  AMD GPUs allocated across the workers.\n57\t- A PyTorchJob submitted through the platform's queueing layer is admitted\n58\t  and starts running on AMD Instinct nodes with amd.com/gpu quota accounted\n59\t  for the job's GPUs, validated from the job side.\n60\t- Training jobs produce correct results (job success criteria met, e.g. loss\n61\t  convergence on a reference workload).\n62\t\n63\t## HLR Traceability\n64\t\n65\t- HLR-3 (P1): PyTorch training on ROCm supported for single- and multi-GPU\n66\t  jobs admitted through Kueue, with amd.com/gpu quota handling — this epic\n67\t  covers the Training Operator side (job execution on ROCm).\n68\t\n69\t## Risks / Notes\n70\t\n71\t- Validation requires access to AMD Instinct hardware — an availability\n72\t  precondition shared with the serving validation campaign and controlled\n73\t  outside the strategy (procurement or partner lab).\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ad37a481215dedbe","agent_id":"a2d6f3ce0b73d0bc8","session_id":"da64fd2d-69d4-4f10-98cf-a5e53b041b70","uuid":"d4525560-23f5-46b2-848f-0280482af1ed","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:37:57.259Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-95ff7f295c7b456d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9020 decomposition"}
